<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche says has no plans to sell DePuy.</title>
<headline>Roche says has no plans to sell DePuy.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roche Holding AG said it had no plans now to sell Delaware-based DePuy Inc, in which it will acquire a majority stake as part of a planned acquisition of Boehringer Mannheim Group.</p>
<p>&quot;I think there is a significant growth market there,&quot; said Fritz Gerber, chairman of Roche's executive committee and board, referring to the U.S. orthopedic products manufacturing firm. Gerber said &quot;no&quot; when asked if DePuy was up for sale.</p>
<p>He made his comments at a news briefing following the announcement of Roche's planned acquisitions earlier Monday.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 63 17340</p>
